    "html": "<p>A student investigates how the dimensions of a wire affect its electrical resistance. The results for two wires made of the same alloy are shown in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Wire</th><th>Length (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span>)</th><th>Diameter (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mm\"></span>)</th><th>Resistance (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span>)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2.0</td><td>0.40</td><td>7.8</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>4.0</td><td>0.80</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R_2\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the resistance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R_2\"></span> of the second wire?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">1.95 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\">15.6 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">3.9 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\">7.8 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li></ol>"
